<title>UK: Amvesco yr pretax profit up 31 pct.</title>
<headline>Amvesco yr pretax profit up 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.6		   vs 13.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs 5.75</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    66.0		   vs 50.4</p>
<p> Income		     236.2		  vs 192.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share figure is fully diluted. Full company name is Amvesco Plc, created from the merger of Invesco Plc and U.S. group AIM Management Group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
